Lexical metaphor annotations were evaluated using a binary classification framework (metaphor / non-metaphor) across {{ rater_count_text }}. Pairwise inter-rater agreement was quantified using Cohen's Kappa together with raw agreement. {% if multirater %}Overall multi-rater agreement was summarized using Fleiss' Kappa and Krippendorff's Alpha. {% endif %}Differences in rater classification tendency were evaluated with Cochran's Q{% if pairwise %}, with pairwise McNemar comparisons{% endif %}. Analyses were also generated by grammatical category and source group. Multiple-comparison adjustment used {{ correction }}. Missing ratings were excluded only from the specific paired or multi-rater calculation that required an observed value; they were never recoded as non-metaphor.
